{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Fight the good [Em]fight [G7]with [Am]all [G]thy [Am7]migh[D]t;
[G]Christ [Bm]is [G]thy [Cmaj7]strength, [Am]and [A]Christ [A7]thy [Dsus]right[D];
[G]Lay hold [B]on [Em]life [G7]and [Am]it [E7]shall [Am]be
[D]Thy [A7]joy [D]and [G]crown [C]e[G]ter[D7]nal[G]ly.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]Run [Em]the [G7]straight [Am]race [G]through [Am7]God's [D]good grace;
[G][Bm]Lift [G]up [Cmaj7]thine [Am]eyes, [A]and [A7]seek [Dsus]His [D]face.
[G]Life [B]with [Em]its [G7]path [Am]before [E7]us [Am]lies;
[D]Christ [A7]is [D]the [G]way, [C]and [G]Christ [D7]the [G]prize.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G]Cast [Em]care [G7]aside, [Am]lean [G]on [Am7]thy [D]guide,
[G][Bm]His [G][Cmaj7]boundless [Am][A]mercy [A7][Dsus]will [D]provide;
[G]Trust, [B]and [Em]the [G7]trusting [Am]soul [E7]shall [Am]prove
[D]Christ [A7]is [D]its [G]life, [C]and [G]Christ [D7]its [G]love.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[G]Faint [Em]not, [G7]nor [Am]fear, [G]His [Am7]arms [D]are near;
[G][Bm]He [G]changeth [Cmaj7]not, [Am][A]and [A7]thou [Dsus]art [D]dear.
[G][B]Only [Em]believe, [G7]and [Am]thou [E7]shalt [Am]see
[D]That [A7]Christ [D]is [G]all [C]in [G]all [D7]to [G]thee.
{end_of_verse}
